\documentclass{article}


\begin{document}


\section{Encodings}

Café and café are spelled differently; naïve résumés use accents.

Values like 一$x$ and ５$y$ sit next to math, and ½$z$ too.

An emoji 👍🏽 stays put, as does a flag 🇨🇳.

Escaped 50\% stays; a real comment follows

\textbf{été}\ignoré after.

Paragraph after extra blank lines.

\end{document}

