Also tiny.

\subsection{B1}
Short.

\subsubsection{B1a}
Still short but this one has a few more words to approach the threshold of fifty tokens maybe.

\section*{C}
A longer section that certainly exceeds the minimum token count because it keeps going with many plain words, numbers like 1, 2 and 3, and punctuation, so that the merge stops here and starts again.

\section{D}
End.
\end{document}

